        "richtext_QiUK3F": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>When you made wishes without a second thought, believed in fairytales and felt like anything was possible.</p><p>A little part of us never stops believing. In wonderful possibilities and in Promises that can last forever.</p><p>Because isn't that what a Promise really is? A belief in something beautiful. In love, in ourselves, in each other. A little piece of hope for all the things yet to come.</p><p><strong>We call that feeling, Whimsy.</strong></p><p>Inspired by the wonder of the stories we grew up with<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">,</span> and the magic of believing anything could happen, our newest collection is a reminder to hold onto that feeling.</p>"
